+// NOTE (2026-09-14): Do NOT PPC_NATIVE_OVERRIDE 0x8015DF4C
+// (DVD::ConvertPathToEntrynum). It is a target of the build-time GENERATED
+// indirect-dispatch table (it is called via CTR / function pointer), and
